Package: sabinaNSBM
Title: Nested Spatial Bayesian Models for Species Distribution
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: Fits nested species distribution models (NSDMs) using hierarchical 
    Bayesian modeling with spatial structure via INLA and inlabru. Allows 
    integration of global and regional scales with multiple coupling structures 
    for intercepts and predictors (unpooled, ordered hierarchical, 
    scale-decomposed, and Bayesian feedback).
